            "review_text": "Tobya\nSaxony-Anhalt, Germany14 contributions\n0\nFINE FOR LUNCH !\nMar 2019\nSPACE: quite impressive, too many animals are displayed inside, Japanese comics are spread everywhere, like a bookstore.\nSTAFF: following me is not fun, a little uncomfortable. With no idea what to suggest\nDISH\n- Boat Sashimi: 50% reduction to 368k. Fresh salmon, fresh and soft scallops. Overall this boat is extremely fresh. Wasabi here is fibroblast, spicy and much more delicious\n- 100k grilled fish: too good, fresh fish is hot and fatty.\n- Chicken with fried flour: fragrant and crispy fried dough. Marinated chicken is very seasoned.\nP / s: the dishes here follow me as a popular Japanese dish. The menu layout is the same. Menu is very diverse. With the price of quality ok, change the space, the layout is not high class\nWhen the cash register is also given Doreamon keychain:\nJapanese boss is super cute\nRead more\nWritten March 7, 2019",
