            "review_text": "S102OOdaniell\nSingapore, Singapore1277 contributions\n0\n4.5/5\nJan 2019 • Solo\nThis is my first stop for a quick dinner during my Vietnam Trip.\n\nAmbience: 5/5\nCleanliness: 4/5\nCustomer Service: 4/5\nQuality of Food: 4.5/5\nValue for Money: 5/5\n\nThe Good: You get authentic Japanese cooking, with a homely feel to it. Storekeeper is also quite friendly, hospitable.\n\nThe Bad: Customer Service can be slightly better.\n\nThe Bottom Line: The Joint makes you feel like you’re in Japan rather than Vietnam. Totally love the feel, will come back again when I’m in the area!\nRead more\nWritten January 15, 2019",
