            "review_text": "bennett2006\nHo Chi Minh City590 contributions\n0\nNice food, a tad ex\nApr 2017 • Couples\nCute deco, ok service and a very nice senior guard. Food was good. We had omelette rice (147k) and pork cutlet/egg rice (189k). Both were nice and tasty and the helpings were quite generous. There's no extra charge (no ++) and that's definitely a plus despite the meal prices being a tad on the high side (this being Vietnam). We'll be back.\n\nAnd oh ... I'm impressed with the toilet. It has that auto butt-wash that 5-star hotels have ... lol!\nRead more\nWritten April 8, 2017",
