            "review_text": "AZ201\n29 contributions\n0\nGood food, massive choice\nJan 2017 • Couples\nWe couldn't get in to our first choice Japanese restaurant across the road so went here instead. The 3rd floor is non-smoking. The menu is massive with a broad selection of Japanese dishes including sushi and sashimi. We went for tempura, gyoza, salads, vegetable soups, grilled salmon, salmon rice cakes, and grilled squid. Tasty and reasonably priced but not cheap by Vietnamese standards. Recommended!\nRead more\nWritten January 10, 2017",
